# Investigation Evidence

This folder contains selected screenshots from my hands-on investigation of the **M57-Jean forensic training image using Autopsy**.

The evidence is organized to demonstrate key stages of my forensic workflow, including:

- Evidence and case analysis
- File-system and deleted-file investigation
- Keyword and artifact triage
- Browser activity analysis
- Email and attachment forensics
- Communication analysis
- Timeline reconstruction and cross-artifact correlation

Only selected investigation-relevant screenshots are included rather than every step performed during the lab.

> **Note:** This project uses a forensic training dataset for educational and portfolio purposes. Observed artifacts are documented separately from analyst interpretation.
